{"title":"Fix selector typo in vigil-app Deployment","body":"Root cause: Declared selector mismatch; selector.matchLabels contains a typo ("vigil-app-typo") that does not match the pod template labels, causing an immutable field error.

Evidence:
Deployment.apps "vigil-app" is invalid: [spec.template.metadata.labels: Invalid value: {"app":"vigil-app"}: `selector` does not match template `labels`, spec.selector: Invalid value: {"matchLabels":{"app":"vigil-app-typo"}}: field is immutable]"}
